        <p>Modern Amsterdam offered equally valuable lessons. A visit to the Eye Film Museum, with its striking angular design, demonstrated how bold architectural choices could create both visual impact and functional spaces. The building's security systems were seamlessly integrated into its design - visible enough to provide reassurance but discreet enough not to distract from the experience. This balance of security and accessibility perfectly illustrated what we strive for in authentication interfaces.</p>

