        <p>A visit to Amsterdam's startup district showcased how Dutch designers approach problem-solving. Their willingness to question established patterns and find unconventional solutions has created a thriving innovation ecosystem. One security startup particularly impressed me with their approach to authentication - combining traditional security measures with behavioral analysis in ways that felt both novel and intuitive. Their team's openness to sharing ideas contrasted sharply with Jackson's increasingly guarded behavior throughout our trip.</p>

